{"schemaVersion":1,"moduleId":"M4-03","example":{"title":"路段行為管制","intro":"讓速率、超車與會車的管制資訊，和道路環境及可用空間一致。","items":[{"id":"speed","title":"速限資訊清楚且位置一致","text":"整合最高速限標誌與速度限制標字，讓駕駛進入路段時能及時確認要求。"},{"id":"environment","title":"減速提示對應道路環境","text":"配合路型及危險處所安排視覺化減速提示，減少道路外觀與速限的落差。"},{"id":"passing","title":"依視距條件處理超車管制","text":"在彎道、近路口或對向視線受限處，檢視禁止超車標誌與標線的搭配。"},{"id":"meeting","title":"狹窄路段明確安排會車","text":"確認先行方向與可停等位置，避免車輛在瓶頸內對峙或逼退已進入的車輛。"}],"moduleId":"M4-03","pageId":"results-module-m4-03","images":[{"key":"results:module-m4-03-current-1","role":"current","label":"現況問題","rotation":0},{"key":"results:module-m4-03-diagram","role":"module","label":"模組圖","rotation":0}],"source":{"file":"chapters/03-modules/14-roadway-behavior-control.typ","sha256":"d7a0b9061e7fc6db22a82e9ccfc03ac943bbfd247c75d36cc3e94679fe0edc08","title":"路段行為管制","moduleId":"M4-03","section":"現況與議題、圖例說明及延伸應用","issuePageId":"m403-speed-issues","diagramPageId":"m403-speed-diagram","representative":"materials/03-modules/M4-03/M4-03_速率管理代表型.svg"}},"assets":{"results:module-m4-03-current-1":{"file":"materials/03-modules/M4-03/M4-03.1_現況議題_01.png","width":1237,"height":743,"moduleId":"M4-03","role":"current","label":"M4-03 現況問題 1","sha256":"9d0106e902001e175e7376e306a2fcf200210606c1ff6a590f5b75600b2a7778"},"results:module-m4-03-diagram":{"file":"materials/03-modules/M4-03/M4-03_速率管理代表型.svg","width":487,"height":1105,"moduleId":"M4-03","role":"module","label":"M4-03 模組圖","sha256":"1e6cf0c453cea6205d10f4880badd569176ab89fabeb1312b0151c261f0cfd2c"}}}
